<title>USA: Specialty to buy Microwave for 2.4 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Specialty to buy Microwave for 2.4 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR CREST, N.M. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty Teleconstructors Inc said Monday it signed a letter of intent to buy private Microwave Tower Service Inc, in exchange for 2,380,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Based on today's opening of Specialty stock at 12-3/8, the deal is valued at $29.5 million.</p>
<p>Microwave, a designer and manufacturer of wireless facilities, posted revenues of $13.5 million and pre-tax net income of about $2.8 million (unaudited) for the fiscal year ended October 31, Specialty said in a statement.</p>
</text>
